<title>USA: Barry's Jewelers names Peter Healey CFO.</title>
<headline>Barry's Jewelers names Peter Healey CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MONROVIA, Calif. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barry's Jewelers Inc said Wednesday it had named Peter Healey executive vice-president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Healey, who most recently served in the same capacity in the financial-services industry, will buy 100,000 shares of Barry's stock, the company said.</p>
<p>Thomas Liston resigned as the company's CFO on February 14.</p>
</text>
